{"id": "en-r-9v3nw8.de", "jokeId": "en-r-9v3nw8", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "reworked", "notes": "'brought you up' rebuilt as 'aufgezogen' (raised a child / pulled up), which echoes Aufzug. Set inside the elevator cabin; the operator is an old man in a red uniform with a bow tie, the passenger in a tie.", "title": "Aufgezogen", "location": "podyezd", "cast": ["muzhik", "ded"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "ded": "old-man"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Ein Mann fährt mit dem Aufzug in den elften Stock.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "ded", "text": "Einen schönen Tag noch, mein Sohn.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Nennen Sie mich nicht Sohn. Sie sind nicht mein Vater.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "ded", "text": "Nein, aber aufgezogen hab ich Sie doch, oder?", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "podyezd", "place": "elevator", "cast": ["muzhik", "ded"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "ded": "old-man"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["tie"], "remove": ["flat-cap"]}, "ded": {"add": ["bow-tie"], "clothes": "#8b1a1a"}}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}]}
{"id": "en-r-6n3pvn.en", "jokeId": "en-r-6n3pvn", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "The husband tells it himself at the breakfast table in the kitchen, wife beside him. Swear words softened in text (Fuck you → Screw you, fucking → freaking), original in uncensored.", "title": "Slip of the Tongue", "location": "kukhnya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "My tongue slipped when I was asking my wife to pass the milk, honey, when we had breakfast yesterday.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "I accidentally said:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Screw you, Helen, you ruined my freaking life.", "uncensored": "Fuck you, Helen, you ruined my fucking life.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "en-r-6n3pvn.ru", "jokeId": "en-r-6n3pvn", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Line-by-line translation; Helen → Лена. Swear words softened in text (нахуй → нафиг, ёбаную → чёртову), original in uncensored.", "title": "Оговорка", "location": "kukhnya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Вчера за завтраком я хотел сказать жене: передай молоко, дорогая. И оговорился.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Я случайно сказал:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Иди нафиг, Лена, ты испортила мне всю мою чёртову жизнь.", "uncensored": "Иди нахуй, Лена, ты испортила мне всю мою ёбаную жизнь.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "en-r-6n3pvn.de", "jokeId": "en-r-6n3pvn", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Line-by-line translation; Helen → Helene. Swear words softened in text (Fick dich → Leck mich, verficktes → verdammtes), original in uncensored.", "title": "Versprecher", "location": "kukhnya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Gestern beim Frühstück wollte ich zu meiner Frau sagen: Reich mir mal die Milch, Schatz. Und hab mich versprochen.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Aus Versehen sagte ich:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Leck mich, Helene, du hast mein verdammtes Leben ruiniert.", "uncensored": "Fick dich, Helene, du hast mein verficktes Leben ruiniert.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "en-r-dh84t8.en", "jokeId": "en-r-dh84t8", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Three scenes: the husband in a black suit with flowers at the cemetery, his pregnant wife beside him; at home the wife with the newborn; later the boy, who wears the dead friend's distinctive mustache, while the husband holds the friend's photo.", "title": "The Prayer", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "My best friend passed away recently.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Bro, I really miss you.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "My wife has been pregnant for eight months now.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "How about you reincarnate as my child?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "A month later, my wife gave birth to a big boy.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "As my child grew older each day, I realized he looks a lot like my best friend.", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "I'm really happy that my prayer worked.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "ulitsa", "place": "cemetery", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["tie"], "remove": ["flat-cap"], "clothes": "#1d1d1d"}, "zhena": {"remove": ["curlers", "apron"], "build": "portly"}}, "beats": [{"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "flowers", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}, {"location": "gostinaya", "transition": "flyover", "cast": ["zhena", "muzhik"], "roles": {"zhena": "wife", "muzhik": "husband"}, "looks": {"zhena": 