{"id": "en-r-dh84t8.de", "jokeId": "en-r-dh84t8", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Line-by-line translation. Three scenes: cemetery with the pregnant wife, home with the newborn, later the boy with the dead friend's mustache while the husband holds the friend's photo.", "title": "Das Gebet", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Vor Kurzem ist mein bester Freund gestorben.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Kumpel, ich vermisse dich wirklich.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Meine Frau ist jetzt seit acht Monaten schwanger.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Wie wär's, wenn du als mein Kind wiedergeboren wirst?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Einen Monat später brachte meine Frau einen großen Jungen zur Welt.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Mit jedem Tag wurde mein Kind älter, und mir fiel auf, dass er meinem besten Freund sehr ähnlich sieht.", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Ich bin wirklich froh, dass mein Gebet funktioniert hat.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "ulitsa", "place": "cemetery", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["tie"], "remove": ["flat-cap"], "clothes": "#1d1d1d"}, "zhena": {"remove": ["curlers", "apron"], "build": "portly"}}, "beats": [{"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "flowers", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}, {"location": "gostinaya", "transition": "flyover", "cast": ["zhena", "muzhik"], "roles": {"zhena": "wife", "muzhi