{"id": "en-r-8b5yoi.de", "jokeId": "en-r-8b5yoi", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Line-by-line translation. 'Das ist wertlos' stays ambiguous, and the artist's 'sagen Sie sie mir' (sie = die Meinung) lands the misreading. Museum hall, artist in a beret, critic with a monocle and a glass.", "title": "Wertlos", "location": "zal", "cast": ["paren", "nachalnik"], "roles": {"paren": "artist", "nachalnik": "aristocrat"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Ein junger Künstler stellt zum ersten Mal seine Werke aus.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Und ein bekannter Kunstkritiker ist auch da.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Möchten Sie meine Meinung zu Ihrem Werk hören?", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Ja.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Das ist wertlos.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Ich weiß, aber sagen Sie sie mir trotzdem.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "zal", "place": "museum", "cast": ["paren", "nachalnik"], "roles": {"paren": "artist", "nachalnik": "aristocrat"}, "crowd": {"who": "people", "size": "few", "at": "front"}, "beats": [{"type": "prop", "who": "nachalnik", "item": "glass", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}]}]}
{"id": "en-r-6l4a85.en", "jokeId": "en-r-6l4a85", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Little Johnny is the vovochka puppet. The friends' reported tip becomes a friend's line on the street; at home Mom and Dad each hand over money and leave, then the mailman (postman costume, letters in hand) arrives at the door.", "title": "I Know Everything", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["vovochka", "vovochka-drug", "devochka"], "roles": {"vovochka": "vovochka", "vovochka-drug": "child", "devochka": "child"}, "lines": [{"character": "vovochka-drug", "text": "Johnny, adults have a deep dark secret and can be easily manipulated.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Johnny decides to test it.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Mom, I know everything.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Mom shushes him and gives him ten dollars.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Just don't tell Dad.", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Hey, it's working.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4, "laugh": "chuckle"}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "An hour later, Dad comes home from work.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Dad, I know everything.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Dad gives Johnny a hundred dollars.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Don't tell Mom.", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Just then, the mailman knocks on the door.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "I know everything, Mister.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "The mailman drops all his mail, his eyes tear up, and he says:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Well then Johnny, come give Daddy a hug.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["vovochka", "vovochka-drug", "devochka"], "roles": {"vovochka": "vovochka", "vovochka-drug": "child", "devochka": "child"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}]}, {"location": "gostinaya", "transition": "flyover", "cast": ["zhena", "vovochka", "muzhik", "paren"], "roles": {"zhena": "mother", "vovochka": "vovochka", "muzhik": "father", "paren": "postman"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["tie"], "remove": ["flat-cap"], "clothes": "#2f2f3a"}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "zhena", "to": "sofa"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "zhena", "item": "money", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "move", "who": "vovochka", "from": "off-left", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "zhena", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "vovochka"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "move", "who": "zhena", "to": "off-right"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "from": "off-left", "to": "left"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "money", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "vovochka"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "off-right"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l11"}, {"type": "move", "who": "vovochka", "to": "left"}, {"type": "move", "who": "paren", "from": "off-left", "to": "door"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "paren", "item": "letter", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l12"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "paren", "item": "letter", "action": "drop"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l13"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l14"}]}]}
{"id": "en-r-6l4a85.ru", "jokeId": "en-r-6l4a85", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Little Johnny → Вовочка, Mister → дяденька, dollars → рубли (сто / тысяча, the tenfold jump kept). Friends' tip becomes a friend's line; Mom and Dad pay up and leave, then the postman arrives at the door.", "title": "Я всё знаю", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["vovochka", "vovochka-drug", "devochka"], "roles": {"vovochka": "vovochka", "vovochka-drug": "child", "devochka": "child"}, "lines": [{"character": "vovochka-drug", "text": "Вовочка, у взрослых есть страшная тайна, и ими легко манипулировать.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Вовочка решает это проверить.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Мама, я всё знаю.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Мама шикает на него и даёт ему сто рублей.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Только папе не говори.", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Ого, работает!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4, "laugh": "chuckle"}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Через час с работы приходит папа.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Папа, я всё знаю.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Папа даёт Вовочке тысячу рублей.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Маме не говори.", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Тут в дверь стучит почтальон.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Я всё знаю, дяденька.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Почтальон роняет всю почту, на глазах у него слёзы, и он говорит:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Ну что ж, Вовочка, иди обними папочку.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["vovochka", "vovochka-drug", "devochka"], "roles": {"vovochka": "vovochka", "vovochka-drug": "child", "devochka": "child"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}]}, {"location": "gostinaya", "transition": "flyover", "cast": ["zhena", "vovochka", "muzhik", "paren"], "roles": {"zhena": "mother", "vovochka": "vovochka", "muzhik": "father", "paren": "postman"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["tie"], "remove": ["flat-cap"], "clothes": "#2f2f3a"}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "zhena", "to": "sofa"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "zhena", "item": "money", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "move", "who": "vovochka", "from": "off-left", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "zhena", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "vovochka"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "move", "who": "zhena", "to": "off-right"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "from": "off-left", "to": "left"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "money", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "vovochka"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "off-right"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l11"}, {"type": "move", "who": "vovochka", "to": "left"}, {"type": "move", "who": "paren", "from": "off-left", "to": "door"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "paren", "item": "letter", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l12"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "paren", "item": "letter", "action": "drop"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l13"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l14"}]}]}
{"id": "en-r-6l4a85.de", "jokeId": "en-r-6l4a85", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Little Johnny → Fritzchen, Mister → mein Herr, dollars → Euro (zehn / hundert). Friends' tip becomes a friend's line; Mom and Dad pay up and leave, then the postman arrives at the door.", "title": "Ich weiß alles", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["vovochka", "vovochka-drug", "devochka"], "roles": {"vovochka": "vovochka", "vovochka-drug": "child", "devochka": "child"}, "lines": [{"character": "vovochka-drug", "text": "Fritzchen, Erwachsene haben ein dunkles Geheimnis und lassen sich leicht manipulieren.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Fritzchen beschließt, es auszuprobieren.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Mama, ich weiß alles.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Mama bringt ihn zum Schweigen und gibt ihm zehn Euro.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Sag nur Papa nichts.", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Hey, es funktioniert.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4, "laugh": "chuckle"}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Eine Stunde später kommt Papa von der Arbeit nach Hause.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Papa, ich weiß alles.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Papa gibt Fritzchen hundert Euro.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Sag Mama nichts.", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Genau da klopft der Briefträger an die Tür.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Ich weiß alles, mein Herr.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Der Briefträger lässt die ganze Post fallen, ihm kommen die Tränen, und er sagt:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Na dann, Fritzchen, komm und drück deinen Papa.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["vovochka", "vovochka-drug", "devochka"], "roles": {"vovochka": "vovochka", "vovochka-drug": "child", "devochka": "child"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}]}, {"location": "gostinaya", "transition": "flyover", "cast": ["zhena", "vovochka", "muzhik", "paren"], "roles": {"zhena": "mother", "vovochka": "vovochka", "muzhik": "father", "paren": "postman"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["tie"], "remove": ["flat-cap"], "clothes": "#2f2f3a"}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "zhena", "to": "sofa"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "zhena", "item": "money", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "move", "who": "vovochka", "from": "off-left", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "zhena", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "vovochka"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "move", "who": "zhena", "to": "off-right"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "from": "off-left", "to": "left"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "money", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "vovochka"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "off-right"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l11"}, {"type": "move", "who": "vovochka", "to": "left"}, {"type": "move", "who": "paren", "from": "off-left", "to": "door"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "paren", "item": "letter", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l12"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "paren", "item": "letter", "action": "drop"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l13"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l14"}]}]}
{"id": "en-d-10969.en", "jokeId": "en-d-10969", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Source wording kept; the sixteen-year-old son tells the setup himself, Dad (with a mustache) boasts in the living room.", "title": "Five Hundred People Under Me", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["paren", "muzhik"], "roles": {"paren": "son", "muzhik": "father"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["mustache"]}}, "lines": [{"character": "paren", "text": "When I turned sixteen, my dad told me it was time to get a job.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "When I was your age, my very first job I had, I worked with over five hundred people under me.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Wow! Was it some big corporation?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "No. I mowed the lawn in the cemetery.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "en-d-10969.ru", "jokeId": "en-d-10969", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "«Подо мной» keeps both meanings (subordinates / buried below), as the adaptNote says. Son tells the setup himself; Dad with a mustache.", "title": "Пятьсот человек подо мной", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["paren", "muzhik"], "roles": {"paren": "son", "muzhik": "father"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["mustache"]}}, "lines": [{"character": "paren", "text": "Когда мне исполнилось шестнадцать, папа сказал, что пора найти работу.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Когда мне было столько же, сколько тебе, на моей самой первой работе подо мной было больше пятисот человек.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Ух ты! Это была какая-то большая корпорация?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Нет. Я косил траву на кладбище.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "en-d-10969.de", "jokeId": "en-d-10969", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "'unter mir' keeps both meanings (subordinates / buried below), as the adaptNote says. Son tells the setup himself; Dad with a mustache.", "title": "Fünfhundert Leute unter mir", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["paren", "muzhik"], "roles": {"paren": "son", "muzhik": "father"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["mustache"]}}, "lines": [{"character": "paren", "text": "Als ich sechzehn wurde, sagte mein Vater, es sei Zeit, mir einen Job zu suchen.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Als ich in deinem Alter war, hatte ich in meinem allerersten Job über fünfhundert Leute unter mir.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Wow! War das ein großer Konzern?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Nein. Ich habe auf dem Friedhof den Rasen gemäht.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "en-r-f7r4x9.en", "jokeId": "en-r-f7r4x9", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Wedding banquet (bar, place party) with guests. The mother is dressed to pass for a man: short hair, stubble, dark suit and tie, no lipstick or apron; the bride in white. 'fucking' softened to 'freaking' in text.", "title": "Mother of the Bride", "location": "bar", "cast": ["devushka-ryzhaya", "zhena", "muzhik"], "roles": {"devushka-ryzhaya": "daughter", "zhena": "mother", "muzhik": "everyman"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "At a wedding, a man whispers to the guy next to him.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Isn't the bride a right ugly dog?", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Do you mind. That's my daughter you're talking about.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "I'm sorry, I didn't know you were her father.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "I'm not... I'm her freaking mother.", "uncensored": "I'm not... I'm her fucking mother.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "bar", "place": "party", "cast": ["devushka-ryzhaya", "zhena", "muzhik"], "roles": {"devushka-ryzhaya": "daughter", "zhena": "mother", "muzhik": "everyman"}, "looks": {"devushka-ryzhaya": {"clothes": "#f7f7f7"}, "zhena": {"add": ["stubble", "tie"], "remove": ["apron", "lipstick"], "hairStyle": "short", "clothes": "#2f2f3a"}, "muzhik": {"add": ["tie"], "remove": ["flat-cap"]}}, "crowd": {"who": "guests", "size": "few"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}]}]}
{"id": "en-r-f7r4x9.ru", "jokeId": "en-r-f7r4x9", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Line-by-line translation; the mother's first line has no gendered verb forms, per adaptNote. Wedding banquet with guests; the mother passes for a man (short hair, stubble, suit and tie). блядь → блин in text.", "title": "Мать невесты", "location": "bar", "cast": ["devushka-ryzhaya", "zhena", "muzhik"], "roles": {"devushka-ryzhaya": "daughter", "zhena": "mother", "muzhik": "everyman"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "На свадьбе мужчина шепчет парню, который стоит рядом:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Невеста-то страшная как собака, да?", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Вы что себе позволяете? Это вообще-то моя дочь.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Простите, я не знал, что вы её отец.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Я не отец... Я её, блин, мать.", "uncensored": "Я не отец... Я её, блядь, мать.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "bar", "place": "party", "cast": ["devushka-ryzhaya", "zhena", "muzhik"], "roles": {"devushka-ryzhaya": "daughter", "zhena": "mother", "muzhik": "everyman"}, "looks": {"devushka-ryzhaya": {"clothes": "#f7f7f7"}, "zhena": {"add": ["stubble", "tie"], "remove": ["apron", "lipstick"], "hairStyle": "short", "clothes": "#2f2f3a"}, "muzhik": {"add": ["tie"], "remove": ["flat-cap"]}}, "crowd": {"who": "guests", "size": "few"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}]}]}
{"id": "en-r-f7r4x9.de", "jokeId": "en-r-f7r4x9", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Line-by-line translation; 'right ugly dog' → 'hässlich wie die Nacht' (natural German). Wedding banquet with guests; the mother passes for a man (short hair, stubble, suit and tie). verfickte → verdammte in text.", "title": "Die Brautmutter", "location": "bar", "cast": ["devushka-ryzhaya", "zhena", "muzhik"], "roles": {"devushka-ryzhaya": "daughter", "zhena": "mother", "muzhik": "everyman"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Auf einer Hochzeit flüstert ein Mann dem Typen neben ihm zu:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Ist die Braut nicht hässlich wie die Nacht?", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Ich muss doch sehr bitten. Das ist meine Tochter, über die Sie da reden.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Entschuldigung, ich wusste nicht, dass Sie ihr Vater sind.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Bin ich nicht... Ich bin ihre verdammte Mutter.", "uncensored": "Bin ich nicht... Ich bin ihre verfickte Mutter.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "bar", "place": "party", "cast": ["devushka-ryzhaya", "zhena", "muzhik"], "roles": {"devushka-ryzhaya": "daughter", "zhena": "mother", "muzhik": "everyman"}, "looks": {"devushka-ryzhaya": {"clothes": "#f7f7f7"}, "zhena": {"add": ["stubble", "tie"], "remove": ["apron", "lipstick"], "hairStyle": "short", "clothes": "#2f2f3a"}, "muzhik": {"add": ["tie"], "remove": ["flat-cap"]}}, "crowd": {"who": "guests", "size": "few"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}]}]}
{"id": "en-d-38081.en", "jokeId": "en-d-38081", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Source wording kept. Bathroom (spalnya, place bathroom); the husband is portly, the wife walks in after his first line. No bathroom scale exists yet, requested in needs.", "title": "The Scale", "location": "spalnya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "My wife caught me standing on the bathroom scale, sucking in my stomach.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Ha! That's not going to help.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Sure, it does.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.6}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "It's the only way I can see the numbers.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "needs": [{"kind": "prop", "id": "bathroom-scale", "description": "a flat bathroom scale on the floor with a dial", "why": "the husband stands on it; the punchline is about seeing its numbers over his belly"}], "scenes": [{"location": "spalnya", "place": "bathroom", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"build": "portly", "remove": ["flat-cap"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "move", "who": "zhena", "from": "off-left", "to": "left"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}]}
